## Solving for Key Variables

**Subtask 3: Determine $s = a+b+c$**

The sum $s^2 - m$ must equal the sum of the right-hand sides, giving an expression for $s$.

<subtask>

<description>
Express the sum of the three right-hand sides $P + Q + R$ in terms of $s$ and $t$, then solve for $s = a+b+c$.
